            **Second-check gaps.** All five closed in the text: R12 names the ten core Specs (matches P3.task and README:303); R3 calls substitutes failures and Q3 agrees; R8/I20/I34 bind every case in every mode, with Q12 recording the in-process and per-slice code gaps (verified main.ts:78-86, :116-118, run.ts:66-72); Q11 and Q13 restated correctly (run.ts:58, falsify.ts:45-49, :61; no `scenarios/` file cites Reads); R6/I12 null excepted, I28 adds I17/I33, T26 split by phase. The repair added no Invariant restating current code.

